2026-07-27T14:57:37.4579757Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:57:37.4580261Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:57:37.4581061Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:57:37.4582819Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:57:37.4583768Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
